<title>USA: GenCorp Inc Q4 Nov 30 net share rises.</title>
<headline>GenCorp Inc Q4 Nov 30 net share rises.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRLAWN, Ohio 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Mos ended 11/30    12 Mos ended 11/30</p>
<p>				  1996    1995	1996     1995</p>
<p> NET SALES			 407.4   450.1   1,514.6  1,771.5</p>
<p>INCOME</p>
<p> Aerospace and defense	  15.4     7.8	42.2     30.2</p>
<p> Polymer products		 21.2    19.0	72.2     57.3</p>
<p> Automotive			  8.0     3.7	19.1     25.2</p>
<p> Unusual items		   (3.4)     4.0    (13.4)	4.0</p>
