<p>     Primary		    33,896  33,491    33,672   32,814</p>
<p>     Fully diluted	    41,334  40,649    41,258   39,972</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 fully diluted EPS included $0.46 from continuing operations, a loss of $0.25 a share from unusual items and a benefit of $0.39 from a tax refund.</p>
<p>Q4 1995 fully diluted EPS include $0.29 from continuing operations and a loss of $(0.08) from unusual items.</p>
